# ---------- 运行痕迹 ----------
*.log
*.pid
*.lock
nohup.out
api_cache/
api_cache_failures/
service_logs/
*.stdout
*.stderr

# ---------- outputs：保留数据集本体，剔除逐条目中间台账 ----------
